  "details": "If Huorong Security Software is enabled while running VRChat, the PC may experience a black screen and restart after a certain period of time. This issue occurs 1 to 5 times per month. It does not occur when other security software is used instead.\n\nSince it directly restarts with a black screen without a blue screen, I cannot find any relevant information in Event Viewer or minidump files.\n\nI believe it is caused by a conflict between EAC (Easy Anti-Cheat) and Huorong Security Software. However, EAC does not accept feedback from individual users.",
